        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="14"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/14/30" n="30"/>And the Lord saved Israel that day from the hand of Egypt and Israel saw Egypt dead on the shore of the sea. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/14/31" n="31"/>Then Israel saw the great hand that the Lord had extended against Egypt, and the people feared the Lord and they believed in the Lord and in Moses His servant. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
